      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://hilltown.org/information/township-history/"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Strassburger Farmstead, a historic farmstead in Hilltown, offers a glimpse into the area's agricultural past.",
